#: ../../source/contents/installation/index.rst:2
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "安装指南"

#: ../../source/contents/installation/index.rst:4
msgid ""
"ResourcePackServer can run in two modes: as a **standalone HTTP server** "
"or as an **MCDReforged plugin**."
msgstr "ResourcePackServer 可以以两种模式运行：**独立 HTTP 服务器** 或 **MCDReforged 插件**。"

#: ../../source/contents/installation/index.rst:6
msgid "You only need to choose **one** mode that fits your setup."
msgstr "你只需要选择一种适合你环境的模式。"

#: ../../source/contents/installation/index.rst:11
msgid "Standalone Mode (install from source)"
msgstr "独立模式（从源码安装）"

#: ../../source/contents/installation/index.rst:13
msgid "Clone the repository and install:"
msgstr "克隆仓库并安装："

#: ../../source/contents/installation/index.rst:21
msgid "Or install with uv:"
msgstr "或使用 uv 安装："

#: ../../source/contents/installation/index.rst:29
msgid "Then run:"
msgstr "然后运行："

#: ../../source/contents/installation/index.rst:35
msgid "See :doc:`/contents/usage/index` for more CLI options."
msgstr "更多 CLI 参数请参见 :doc:`/contents/usage/index`。"

#: ../../source/contents/installation/index.rst:40
msgid "MCDReforged Plugin Mode"
msgstr "MCDReforged 插件模式"

#: ../../source/contents/installation/index.rst:42
msgid "Clone the repository:"
msgstr "克隆仓库："

#: ../../source/contents/installation/index.rst:48
msgid ""
"Copy the ``src/resource_pack_server/`` folder into your MCDR ``plugins/``"
" directory."
msgstr "将 ``src/resource_pack_server/`` 文件夹复制到 MCDR 的 ``plugins/`` 目录中。"

#: ../../source/contents/installation/index.rst:50
msgid "The plugin will auto-load. Use ``!!rps status`` to verify."
msgstr "插件将自动加载。使用 ``!!rps status`` 验证。"

#: ../../source/contents/installation/index.rst:53
msgid "Dependencies"
msgstr "依赖"

#: ../../source/contents/installation/index.rst:55
msgid "This plugin depends on:"
msgstr "此插件依赖："

#: ../../source/contents/installation/index.rst:57
msgid "MCDReforged >= 2.14.1"
msgstr "MCDReforged >= 2.14.1"

#: ../../source/contents/installation/index.rst:59
msgid "No other external dependencies are required (stdlib-only HTTP server)."
msgstr "不需要其他外部依赖（仅使用标准库 HTTP 服务器）。"

#: ../../source/contents/installation/index.rst:63
msgid ""
"Make sure MCDReforged is installed and configured first. Visit the `MCDR "
"docs <https://docs.mcdreforged.com>`__ for guidance."
msgstr ""
"请确保已安装并配置了 MCDReforged。请查阅 `MCDR 文档 <https://docs.mcdreforged.com>`__ "
"获取指导。"

